    <worksheet name='Help Button'>
      <table>
        <view>
          <datasources>
            <datasource caption='UNVoting Hyper Extract' name='federated.1gr10jb0j3o66z10jaa3g0bg7gmw' />
          </datasources>
          <datasource-dependencies datasource='federated.1gr10jb0j3o66z10jaa3g0bg7gmw'>
            <column caption='Info' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_538743121764569088]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
              <calculation class='tableau' formula='&quot;i&quot;' />
            </column>
            <column-instance column='[Calculation_538743121764569088]' derivation='None' name='[none:Calculation_538743121764569088:nk]' pivot='key' type='nominal' />
          </datasource-dependencies>
          <aggregation value='true' />
        </view>
        <style>
          <style-rule element='cell'>
            <format attr='height' value='59' />
            <format attr='text-align' value='center' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='label'>
            <format attr='text-align' value='center' />
            <format attr='font-family' field='[federated.1gr10jb0j3o66z10jaa3g0bg7gmw].[none:Calculation_538743121764569088:nk]' value='Const' />
          </style-rule>
          <style-rule element='worksheet'>
            <format attr='font-size' value='22' />
            <format attr='font-family' value='Courier New' />
            <format attr='color' value='#ffffff' />
          </style-rule>
        </style>
        <panes>
          <pane selection-relaxation-option='selection-relaxation-allow'>
            <view>
              <breakdown value='auto' />
            </view>
            <mark class='Circle' />
            <mark-sizing mark-sizing-setting='marks-scaling-off' />
            <encodings>
              <text column='[federated.1gr10jb0j3o66z10jaa3g0bg7gmw].[none:Calculation_538743121764569088:nk]' />
            </encodings>
            <customized-tooltip>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Data</run>
                <run>
UN voting resolution data was provided by the  UN Library.  The data include voting information by resolution code and custom category mapping.  Additional dataesets covering - USD GDP, Global Terror Index, Womens Power Index &amp; World Happiness Report have been added to support cluster analysis.

</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Scoring</run>
                <run>
Votes are categorized by Y, N, Abstain and NaN (Absent).  Vote scores are computed for a target country and all other countries.  The scoring methedology uses 1 for the same direction, 0 for opposite and .5 for a vote and abstain (on either side).  An absent country will recieve a NaN and will not be counted.  The score is represented as a dyanmic percentage via the VotingCoincidence calculated field.  This final value represents the percentage of same direction votes between the coincidence country and all other countries. 

</run>
                <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold'>Filtering</run>
                <run>
  * Coincidence Country Name - The root/base country to perform the analysis.

* Voting Coincidence - The slider allows for filtering of alternate countries based on what percentage they vote with the selected coincidence country.

  * Top Level Issue - The top category heirarchy description.  A select will filter child sub-category members.
*  Year of Action - Resolution year</run>
              </formatted-text>
            </customized-tooltip>
            <style>
              <style-rule element='mark'>
                <format attr='mark-labels-cull' value='true' />
                <format attr='size' value='1.263370156288147' />
                <format attr='has-stroke' value='true' />
                <format attr='stroke-color' value='#4e79a7' />
                <format attr='mark-labels-show' value='true' />
              </style-rule>
              <style-rule element='pane'>
                <format attr='minheight' value='-1' />
                <format attr='maxheight' value='-1' />
              </style-rule>
            </style>
          </pane>
        </panes>
        <rows />
        <cols />
        <mark-labels>
